Replace BOOTNODE_ENODE in all scripts with your actual bootnode enode.
For the lite node, replace RPC_URL with your RPC node URL (optional, but recommended).
Copy genesis.json to each node’s DATA_DIR before running the script.
Make scripts executable:
chmod +x setup-fullnode.sh setup-litenode.sh
sudo bash setup-fullnode.sh
sudo bash setup-litenode.sh
Logs are in /var/log/gydschain-* per node.



2️⃣ Lite Node Installer

Lite nodes are lightweight, fast, and only store essential blockchain data. They connect to bootnode & RPC.

1️⃣ Full Node Installer

This node stores the full blockchain, validates blocks, and optionally serves RPC.

1️⃣ RPC Node Installer

The RPC node exposes your blockchain for apps and users. It connects to your Bootnode and validator but doesn’t mine blocks.

✅ How to Use
Copy your Bootnode enode into the BOOTNODE_ENODE variable
Copy your validator wallet address into VALIDATOR_WALLET
Copy your genesis.json to /var/lib/gydschain/genesis.json
Run:
